    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "22. Other Rules And Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "22.04",
    "summary": "The [datasheet](vsdata:core-rule/datasheets)’s **Wargear Abilities** entries describe equipment benefits. The unit gains an entry’s benefit from the corresponding item whether the unit carries it or a single member does. A model carrying such an item counts as its bearer. Destroying that bearer ends the unit’s benefit.",
